Learning Outcomes
After completing this assignment, students will be able to:
Load datasets using Pandas. 
Create professional line charts. 
Customize markers and line styles. 
Add titles, labels, legends, and grids. 
Create scatter plots for relationship analysis. 
Build multi-chart dashboards using subplots. 
Interpret business data using visualizations. 
Produce industry-style analytical reports suitable for business presentations. 
